# L §5.15: "An ask that reaches crps or pdf states orient lower or orient higher (LOAD-ORIENT), whatever it prints".
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

index is2 = [i1, i2]
input x[i in is2]: num
input wt[i in is2]: num
input y: num
def cs: num = crps(x[i] for i in is2, y) at reader

version v
  cite s
  governs 2026..
  known 2026-01-01
  x[i1] = 1
  x[i2] = 3
  y = 2

ask a: cs law 2026-06-30
=== expect
refused: LOAD-ORIENT ...
